 YT Music Player   Queue   Search   Library                          Lan (@lan)
──────────────────━━━━━━━───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

 Keys  Click selects, again plays; Shift-, Option- or Fn-drag selects text
   space  Play or pause
   n / p  Next or previous song
   ← / →  Back or forward 5 seconds
   + / -  Volume up or down
   s      Shuffle on or off
   r      Repeat off, all or one
   ↑ / ↓  Select
   enter  Play, open or retry
   a / ⌫  Add to or remove from the queue
   l      Like or unlike
   /      Search
   tab    Queue, Search, Library
   esc    Back, or stop typing
   R      Reconnect, or restart the background player
   ?      Show or hide the keys
   q      Quit; the music plays on
